  )
  (text "Watchdog timeout 170-230 ms (200 ms typical) using factory timing; WDO is open drain.\nA frozen Teensy is detected electrically. Jetson link loss still requires firmware to stop kicking / disarm.\nPose-hold, controlled sitting, fall response and recovery are unimplemented firmware and physical validation tasks."
    (at 15 24 0)
    (effects
